		<RichText x="67" y="672" fontFamily="MiSans" fontSize="20" fontStyle="normal" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff" width="86" height="26" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="1">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="MiSans" fontSize="20" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">幻雷护罩：</p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="66" y="865" fontFamily="MiSans" fontSize="20" fontStyle="normal" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff" width="87" height="26" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="1">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="MiSans" fontSize="20" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">凌朽烈风：</p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<Group d:userLabel="ICON__FRAME" d:type="layer" visible="false">
			<Rect x="640" y="832" width="128" height="128" alpha="1" blendMode="normal" radiusX="0" radiusY="0">
				<fill>
					<SolidColor color="#ffffff"/>
				</fill>
			</Rect>
			<Rect x="992" y="832" width="128" height="128" alpha="1" blendMode="normal" radiusX="0" radiusY="0">
				<fill>
					<SolidColor color="#ffffff"/>
				</fill>
			</Rect>
			<Rect x="800" y="832" width="128" height="128" alpha="1" blendMode="normal" radiusX="0" radiusY="0">
				<fill>
					<SolidColor color="#d6d6d6"/>
				</fill>
			</Rect>
			<Rect x="1152" y="832" width="128" height="128" alpha="1" blendMode="normal" radiusX="0" radiusY="0">
				<fill>
					<SolidColor color="#d6d6d6"/>
				</fill>
			</Rect>
		</Group>
		<RichText x="66" y="704" width="506" height="116" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="16" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffacff">12雷<span color="#ffffff">盾，持续整个「唤雷」形态。护罩破坏后陷入瘫痪</span><span color="#ffdfbf">12s</span><span color="#ffffff">。<br/>受</span><span color="#bfdfff">「星烁反应」</span><span color="#ffffff">影响后，施放爆发技能会使该护罩</span><span>-4雷</span><span color="#ffffff">，同时中断技能，并掉落6枚</span><span>雷元素</span><span color="#ffffff">晶球。<br/></span><span color="#ffbfbf">(N5) </span><span color="#ffffff">护罩厚度提升至</span><span>40雷</span><span color="#ffffff">，且受</span><span color="#bfdfff">「星烁反应」</span><span color="#ffffff">影响后</span><span>-16雷</span><span color="#ffffff">；护罩破坏后会对翼骏狮造成一次真伤，其值由护罩展开期间</span><span color="#ffdfbf">100%星反应伤+30%其余伤害</span><span color="#ffffff">组成，不超过</span><span color="#ffdfbf">80%翼骏狮生命值</span><span color="#ffffff">。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="66" y="896" width="508" height="97" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="16" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">「驱风」形态下召唤5枚风球，<span color="#ffdfbf">5s</span><span>后将开始向翼骏狮移动。若翼骏狮吸收的风球少于3个，那么技能施放失败，瘫痪</span><span color="#ffdfbf">16s</span><span>。<br/>受</span><span color="#bfdfff">「星烁反应」</span><span>影响后，翼骏狮将不能吸收风球，直接中断技能，并掉落6枚</span><span color="#7fffd7">风元素</span><span>晶球，同时扣除</span><span color="#ffdfbf">15%生命值</span><span>。<br/></span><span color="#ffbfbf">(N5) </span><span>移除扣除生命值的效果。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<BitmapImage source="@Embed('/星芒之役-嵌合翼骏狮%B7摧枯伟力.assets/Image_17.png')" x="1166" y="847" blendMode="normal">
